 "summary": "The Banach-valued weighted prime sum, its partial summation and its Mellin identity are not in Mathlib, whose Abel summation (sum_mul_eq_sub_integral_mul) takes only RCLike coefficients, or in Tau Ceti, whose sum_Icc_rpow_mul_eq takes only real coefficients; no existing (1 + log t)\u00b2 majorant or matching integrability lemma was found. The PR reuses mellinWeightIntegral, integrableOn_Ioi_rpow_of_lt, log_le_rpow_div, harmonic_le_one_add_log and the Nat.primesLE API.",
